# CFactory code owners
#
# Owners are auto-requested as reviewers on PRs touching matching paths.
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# CFactory currently has one collaborator, verified via
# `gh api repos/olafkfreund/CFactory/collaborators` before writing this file
# (see the PR that added it for the exact command and output). Every rule
# below names that collaborator on purpose — do not add a login here without
# checking it first: a CODEOWNERS entry naming someone who isn't a
# collaborator is silently ignored by GitHub (see Factory#611).
#
# `require_code_owner_reviews` is currently false on both `dev` and `main`
# branch protection, so this file documents intent rather than gating
# anything yet — it becomes enforced the day that setting flips.
#
# Order matters — later patterns override earlier ones.

# Default — all files
*                            @olafkfreund

# Release and supply-chain surface
/.github/workflows/deploy.yml  @olafkfreund
/charts/                       @olafkfreund
/Dockerfile                    @olafkfreund

# Governance files themselves
/CODEOWNERS                    @olafkfreund
/SECURITY.md                   @olafkfreund
